ased input_crop_size (224→312) and set depth_factor=5.0; updated forward to concatenate flipped inputs/specs and average paired outputs for flip TTA; halved DataLoader batch_size (//2) to accommodate do | score after: 0.28450 (-0.00449)\nv103 -> v104: Include the X3D model's predictions into the ensemble averaging (enable run_weight_x3d and append its outputs) to improve final ensemble performance. | change: Uncommented the call to run_weight_x3d() and appended its returned predictions to the predictions list; adjusted nearby comment. | score after: 0.27115 (+0.01335)\nv104 -> v105: Use a slightly larger input window (rr 20→30) for the AlaskaDataIter and drop one ensemble member's predictions to improve ensemble inference performance. | change: Changed AlaskaDataIter parameter rr from 20 to 30 in two inference data loader instantiations (increasing right-bound/window) and commented out run_weight_double_head() plus its predictions.append(...) so that member is excluded from the ensemble. | score after: 0.31083 (-0.03967)\nv105 -> v106: Tweak the test-time input window (rr) used by AlaskaDataIter (including flip TTA) from 30 to 20 to change the model's inference input region and attempt to improve predictions. | change: Two instantiations of AlaskaDataIter used for inference (standard and flip TTA) changed the rr parameter value from 30 to 20. | score after: 0.28677 (+0.02406)\nv106 -> v107: Replace the previous 3D-spectrogram model with a new EEG/raw-based model pipeline (reshape -> 3-channel -> EfficientNet) and update weight paths to improve ensemble/inference performance. | change: Renamed CFG key from weights_x3d_m to weights_eeg_raw and rebuilt its file list; removed spectrogram-transform and several x3d_m classes (Transformx3d_m, Modelx3d_m, Netx3d_m) and added a new Net1d class that reshapes raw EEG into 3-channel inputs, u | score after: 0.29899 (-0.01222)\nv107 -> v108: Improve final ensemble submission by replacing the eeg_raw member with the x3d member in the prediction blend. | change: Uncommented the run_weight_x3d() call and its predictions.append(ans), and commented out run_weight_eeg_raw() and its append — effectively swapping ensemble members. | score after: 0.30242 (-0.00343)\nv108 -> v109: Enable inclusion of the run_weight_eeg_raw model's predictions in the ensemble averaging to (attempt to) improve final submission score. | change: Two lines uncommented: call run_weight_eeg_raw() and append its output to predictions, thereby adding that model's predictions into the ensemble. | score after: 0.27038 (+0.03203)\nv109 -> v110: Fix tensor reshape to match expected input dimensions and remove the X3D model from the ensemble to improve inference accuracy. | change: Adjusted the model forward() tensor view/reshape/permute dimensions (from view(bs,16,500,20) / reshape to (bs,16*20,500) to view(bs,16,1000,10) / reshape to (bs,16*10,1000)). Also commented out the run_weight_x3d() call and its predictions append, re | score after: 0.27637 (-0.00598)\nv110 -> v111: Include the X3D model's predictions in the ensemble blend at inference time to try to improve final score. | change: Uncommented ans = run_weight_x3d() and predictions.append(ans) (previously commented out) to add X3D model outputs into the stacked/blended predictions; minor comment text adjusted. | score after: 0.25772 (+0.01864)\nv111 -> v112: Adjust the model head and tensor layout to produce compatible/finer-grained features and remove the X3D model from the ensemble to improve inference accuracy. | change: Added a neck Linear layer and updated extract_features to reshape model outputs and pass through the new neck; changed input reshaping/permute/reshape dimensions (16,1000,10 -> 16,2500,4); commented out AdaptiveAvgPool2d usage; and commented out runn | score after: 0.27837 (-0.02065)\nv112 -> v113: Replace the previous spectrogram-transform path with new per-model feature extractors (EfficientNet-based Modeleeg and adjusted X3D Modelspec), restructure